// Flip GmbH — logical schema reconstructed from the supplied LookML export.
// Not warehouse DDL. Types, primary keys and cardinalities are LookML declarations, not verified constraints.
// Base + extended views are merged; alias roles are preserved in named Refs and their provenance comments.
// A dimension_group is shown once; only join-used timeframes are expanded into extra fields.
// Measures and parameters are table notes, not columns. Hidden dimensions are retained.
// Full-outer/left join behavior, Liquid and extra predicates are preserved as comments, not encoded by DBML edges.
// UNNEST containment is documented without inventing FK columns. Missing references use type unknown.
// Identical relationships across Explores share one edge with all provenance retained.
Project flip_lookml {
  Note: 'Internal sales/marketing funnel, revenue retention and product adoption. Logical LookML schema, not a deployable physical schema. Original BigQuery table paths appear in table notes. No database connection or data validation was performed.'
}

